        <item>
            <title>1.1.4</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:27:30 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>SnapUI 1.1.4: after you let go of ⌥D or ⌥R, a small bar shows where it's going and sends in three seconds (any key stops it; ↑ picks somewhere else). Holding ⌥R now spotlights the window with your words as you speak. And new names: Stack is now Tuck, Clip is now Record.</p>
]]></description>
